+convergence).  gamma=1.2 dominates: worst failing eta ~= 2.90 at angle
+~= 1.415 rad, scale ~= 2.61 (isotropic caustic-relative radius). gamma=1.5
+and gamma=2.0 give substantially lower boundaries (~2.2 and ~1.5
